ith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-catalog/commits/2770a4d0059180b2563180d1ebbf5fe58a16af21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T17:49:57Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T17:49:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: refresh src/slots/README with the full slot inventory (#138)\n\nThe README''s \"Not yet ported\" section listed 9 slots (the Course\nCatalog set + CourseAboutCourseImage + CourseAboutEnrollmentButton)\nthat have since been ported. All 26 leaf slots now have a component\n+ README under src/slots/, so the \"Not yet ported\" section is\ndropped and a new \"Course Catalog page\" grouping is added alongside\nthe existing Home / Course About / Generic sections.\n\nThe opening paragraph is also fixed: not every subdirectory is a\nleaf slot — some (HomePromoVideoSlots, CourseAboutIntroVideoSlots,\nCourseCatalogDataTableSlots) are grouping dirs whose index.tsx\nre-exports child slots.\n\nVerified: every dir with a `id=\"org.openedx.frontend.slot.catalog...`\ndeclaration is linked from the README, and every README link\ntargets a real leaf slot dir. 26 ↔ 26. (Legacy had a 27th entry\nunder plugin-slots/FooterSlot/ but it was README+images only, a\nwrapper doc for @edx/frontend-component-footer''s slot rather than\nan owned slot; frontend-base''s shell now provides the footer, so\nnothing to port.)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be533830270db643e0c1a1c12774329ada4291ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-catalog/git/trees/be533830270db643e0c1a1c12774329ada4291ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-catalog/git/commits/2770a4d0059180b2563180d1ebbf5fe58a16af21","verification":{"payload":"tree be533830270db643e0c1a1c12774329ada4291ed\nparent 5e4948f10d045024b640708049b961269c8988b1\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1786384197 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786384197 -0400\n\ndocs: refresh src/slots/README with the full slot inventory (#138)\n\nThe README''s \"Not yet ported\" section listed 9 slots (the Course\nCatalog set + CourseAboutCourseImage + CourseAboutEnrollmentButton)\nthat have since been ported. All 26 leaf slots now have a component\n+ README under src/slots/, so the \"Not yet ported\" section is\ndropped and a new \"Course Catalog page\" grouping is added alongside\nthe existing Home / Course About / Generic sections.\n\nThe opening paragraph is also fixed: not every subdirectory is a\nleaf slot — some (HomePromoVideoSlots, CourseAboutIntroVideoSlots,\nCourseCatalogDataTableSlots) are grouping dirs whose index.tsx\nre-exports child slots.\n\nVerified: every dir with a `id=\"org.openedx.frontend.slot.catalog...`\ndeclaration is linked from the README, and every README link\ntargets a real leaf slot dir. 26 ↔ 26. (Legacy had a 27th entry\nunder plugin-slots/FooterSlot/ but it was README+images only, a\nwrapper doc for @edx/frontend-component-footer''s slot rather than\nan owned slot; frontend-base''s shell now provides the footer, so\nnothing to port.)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqeg9FCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARDIQADrUiHwXFLVI8oMlVPESgO89\ng+ioqBHlejwzuoTAzihV+9XupA39CZhKuOo+psUFMqnWRgUyPAkNyDhjW01dltYi\nK07eIUO36/bXibwGfYta8yqliG5WFKvHvdfk2s3Nr6DXSEDV7+ZyLOyuMad4LSra\nr/QrrTcmAm6MPI0gjcCr0/IL0abBkR06ZM8/uZ6Rue9X19/7QkjqNKt9S+AiVHHA\nScjYt4d+qPYHgmw3tgCMDEpStgUi7tp4gIjEC0cb/5z+q4Tk76sDiioepTJhuSTr\ncfQw81Q7K69Py1r5MBZIYd3bKpJMLcz9y7Ukytw+dH9gglEGL+r7jS/E988ceAjg\n5gR4WMsAwSz3hBSzNhNxG0Me5Xg1SLb8wVvv/nOeH/TYzMHUcIttXdcwCDolq9O0\njDJK44Em3fsPTap0FK95kbiMCumNoPDfZTsZEMy6dUGE/2gSt3DRILzGHFJKInGd\nwsvqLHk49gVm1EXR9598rxbSO2ei2mOun7931TKp7R2lC3d8FWVCohBfCK7zhxZU\nZS++BdNMyT