tate management integration\n- Component communication (props, emits, provide/inject)\n- Performance optimization (lazy loading, v-memo, computed)\n- Error handling (global handlers, component error capture)\n- Testing strategies (component and composable testing)\n- Security practices (input sanitization, XSS prevention)\n- Accessibility implementation\n\n## Impact:\n- Completes previously incomplete best-practices.md files\n- Provides comprehensive guidance for React Native mobile development\n- Covers Vue 3 modern patterns with Composition API focus\n- Addresses missing content from deleted documentation branch\n- React Native: 25% → 35% completion (improved mobile-specific guidance)\n- Vue: 45% → 65% completion (comprehensive modern Vue practices)","tree":{"sha":"6c1c1d49ca70cf71b209db5bf84961835cabdf50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tecnomanu/agent-rules-kit/git/trees/6c1c1d49ca70cf71b209db5bf84961835cabdf50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tecnomanu/agent-rules-kit/git/commits/1d35d69f3eb2cdcfba5adaafd07c5ddd62414d2c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/591261?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tecnomanu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tecnomanu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tecnomanu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tecnomanu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tecnomanu","id":591261,"login":"tecnomanu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTI2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tecnomanu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tecnomanu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tecnomanu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tecnomanu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/te