/staff-portal/commits/9fb4d992463517a54c2c3255bd40668d7380fffa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:06:11Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:06:11Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"perf: Load the assistant''s chat code only where it is shown\n\nEvery page under the Milo and private layouts preloaded about 1.2 MB of\nassistant code (streamdown, shiki, mermaid, tiptap, the AI SDK) because:\n\n- The assistant barrel re-exported AssistantWorkspace and the staff\n  config. Their dependency graphs include modules with side effects, so\n  Rollup kept them on every importer of the barrel (the layouts and\n  navbars) even though nothing there used them.\n- The panel statically imported the staff config, which imports\n  @datum-cloud/datum-ui/assistant.\n\nThe barrel now exports only the provider, panel, trigger and hook. The\ndashboard imports the workspace and config from their own files, and\nthe panel loads the config inside its existing lazy import.\n\nOn the service-catalog workloads route, first-load JavaScript drops from\n3,355 KB to 2,183 KB raw (1,085 KB to 716 KB gzipped). Only the\ndashboard route now preloads the assistant chunks.","tree":{"sha":"7a20d863ed752a485845cbf2a0240165d1613103","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/trees/7a20d863ed752a485845cbf2a0240165d1613103"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/commits/9fb4d992463517a54c2c3255bd40668d7380fffa","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a20d863ed752a485845cbf2a0240165d1613103\nparent 943df0d9cb0dccc9137cfb44ce77f430b0ae334e\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791417971 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791417971 -0700\n\nperf: Load the assistant''s chat code only where it is shown\n\nEvery page under the Milo and private layouts preloaded about 1.2 MB of\nassistant code (streamdown, shiki, mermaid, tiptap, the AI SDK) because:\n\n- The assistant barrel re-exported AssistantWorkspace and the staff\n  config. Their dependency graphs include modules with side effects, so\n  Rollup kept them on every importer of the barrel (the layouts and\n  navbars) even though nothing there used them.\n- The panel statically imported the staff config, which imports\n  @datum-cloud/datum-ui/assistant.\n\nThe barrel now exports only the provider, panel, trigger and hook. The\ndashboard imports the workspace and config from their own files, and\nthe panel loads the config inside its existing lazy import.\n\nOn the service-catalog workloads route, first-load JavaScript drops from\n3,355 KB to 2,183 KB raw (1,085 KB to 716 KB gzipped). Only the\ndashboard route now preloads the assistant chunks.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmrG3noACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j2tVxAApZG39zp1tPuJVhFgOEoGJY2dMMpyWWQcwo0Ou8njcpQSYZTI8VEafvT8\noN/knnAsebH0tjib/Woz+/nrsUghkLorHbnpk0DPhN/0orD4fOeTl0/1efffbdDg\nGwxPIRZ+IJDnL+ARAsaVWGOwnY0e4z5X0N1n5shXoQtcw2It1skXjqsM+nsphmIA\nOPT9WAQjFvYmeRG7uOlXtMwjXRCExAYeN++SsjnyVRHG9XOxupqcSCRqqUf9pavx\nHZ/0EzOUh/QJnxmlsZT2+6aC02Gk165+91J6utk6r6R3NNqrFEfFUb8hbxj//Y//\ndKocSDt0e4kUO/I7I+MtvTDX3u+ok/XeAH1+c4ISDB3bxLF6v+VWAOTb1o1B60c1\nubv3KKZB7CYUITSzdxbFaB53TAAcB/cgCsuCuWv83/KTGojIHDZtLYVbkBergv6p\nN6OovRSuNCElnBwuPLgniIZkxfNs6pasjdYkMoNLZe+XapCOc6DDACVLAzENsU79\nMHnwHKuMci1VYodYZ2fyEMYCWZoVKZ/FBYm38FgeydVL6sYNT2OG3c4deAMjGwp5\nClGAztqyV5mK4+/6EjWZ454isqKzMSAEPB3o6JVG926ikPKciOQ3kyJMN90NFfdT\nKWTeSamUJqm1HvTvC3eykzA8h4Np0KXpI2m1HtHRXQkHJiiRE8E=\n=e161\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T00:06:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_ur