ns","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/6f74ab89042d2fd84cd4ed62bd92ad94b97745af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:54:23Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:54:50Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"feat: Show plugin pages in the project breadcrumb\n\nThe project plugin mount is one splat route with no breadcrumb, so a\nplugin page such as a workload or instance detail stopped the trail at\nthe project.\n\nLet a route handle''s breadcrumb return a list, and have the plugin\nmount return the plugin name plus one crumb for each splat prefix that\nmatches one of the plugin''s portal.page/project paths. Literal segments\nsuch as \"instances\" are skipped instead of linking to the plugin''s\nnot-found page.","tree":{"sha":"c923fe7e89ddff0c3b488572e1e941c2ee8fdfa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/trees/c923fe7e89ddff0c3b488572e1e941c2ee8fdfa6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/commits/6f74ab89042d2fd84cd4ed62bd92ad94b97745af","verification":{"payload":"tree c923fe7e89ddff0c3b488572e1e941c2ee8fdfa6\nparent ae64938688909a206daaf8ebb0a12911ac9dca33\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791399263 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791399290 -0700\n\nfeat: Show plugin pages in the project breadcrumb\n\nThe project plugin mount is one splat route with no breadcrumb, so a\nplugin page such as a workload or instance detail stopped the trail at\nthe project.\n\nLet a route handle''s breadcrumb return a list, and have the plugin\nmount return the plugin name plus one crumb for each splat prefix that\nmatches one of the plugin''s portal.page/project paths. Literal segments\nsuch as \"instances\" are skipped instead of linking to the plugin''s\nnot-found page.\n","reason":"val