45af","node_id":"C_kwDOOl0d89oAKDZmNzRhYjg5MDQyZDJmZDg0Y2Q0ZWQ2MmJkOTJhZDk0Yjk3NzQ1YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commit/ae64938688909a206daaf8ebb0a12911ac9dca33","sha":"ae64938688909a206daaf8ebb0a12911ac9dca33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/ae64938688909a206daaf8ebb0a12911ac9dca33"}],"sha":"6f74ab89042d2fd84cd4ed62bd92ad94b97745af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/6f74ab89042d2fd84cd4ed62bd92ad94b97745af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/ae64938688909a206daaf8ebb0a12911ac9dca33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:54:10Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:54:50Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"fix: Let plugins list metric label values\n\nPlugin metric views ask /api/metrics for the values of a label\n(type \"labels\") to find which instances have series before querying\nthem. The staff-portal Prometheus service only accepted chart, card,\ninstant, connection, and buildinfo, so the compute provider plugin got\n\"Unsupported query type\" and every workload CPU and memory value\nshowed as a dash.\n\nPort getLabels from cloud-portal and add the labels case. The label\nname is interpolated into the upstream URL path, so reject anything\nthat is not a valid Prometheus label name, and require match to be a\nstring.","tree":{"sha":"843d2430d2914a45f4d20a9272ebe9db8a5a685e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/trees/843d2430d2914a45f4d20a9272ebe9db8a5a685e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/commits/ae64938688909a206daaf8ebb0a12911ac9dca33","verification":{"payload":"tree 843d2430d2914a45f4d20a9272ebe9db8a5a685e\nparent b5c377dc6c668f09cc759776ad1604db4609d5f3\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791399250 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1791399290 -0700\n\nfix: Let plugins list metric label values\n\nPlugin metric views ask /api/metrics for the values of a label\n(type \"labels\") to find which instances have series before querying\nthem. The staff-portal Prometheus service only accepted chart, card,\ninstant, connection, and buildinfo, so the compute provider plugin got\n\"Unsupported query type\" and every workload CPU and memory value\nshowed as a dash.\n\nPort getLabels from cloud-portal and add the labels case. The label\nname is interpolated into the upstream URL path, so reject anything\nthat is not a valid Prometheus label name, and require match to be a\nstring.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmrGlXoACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j343w//ZjvVOFMKyB+NeQEPTUgNFuDl7umo2J0XTRy9VKJdDUjQNtOR92xH7mXz\nhRXynXaUnheq8ARzw2NBVSgfiO1n3WcFcSGonrl5v1Qezn9UBKanV5yD4eQcwwhb\n3ZavvwcgV2Mv4MgpKtTd8CbjUZut1zGiA6Yw2n8z8n5+DDmzxQ4ADcB+2R71YFZh\n2sixRXBDzUz9EvxZvk/NbJmKnueYAciRSHgiin9TSCRUl1