c294","sha":"9a85ddae04e2946d732c767417bcef0095bec294","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/9a85ddae04e2946d732c767417bcef0095bec294"}],"sha":"66bea3ef21cca36ef6a9c4d984df9e74d559bfd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/66bea3ef21cca36ef6a9c4d984df9e74d559bfd3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3510868?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yahyafakhroji","id":3510868,"login":"yahyafakhroji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTA4Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/9a85ddae04e2946d732c767417bcef0095bec294/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:01:03Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:01:03Z","email":"yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com","name":"Yahya Fakhroji"},"message":"chore(openapi): regenerate the iam and identity clients from staging\n\nRegenerated both groups against the live staging spec. milo#782 is\nserved there, so User.status.emailVerification now comes from the\ngenerated iam types and the hand-written iam stub is not needed.\n\nStaging also changed the identity group in ways this has to follow:\n- the schema keys moved from com.miloapis.go.milo to go.miloapis.com,\n  so every identity type is now prefixed GoMiloapisComMilo; the one\n  Session import in the profile page is renamed to match\n- Passkey list and read are generated now\n- Session.status dropped expiresAt and gained lastUpdatedAt and\n  userAgent, so the profile sessions table shows \"Last updated\" where\n  it showed \"Expires\", which could no longer be filled\n\nPasskeyRegistrationLink is still missing from staging: zitadel-provider\n#135 has not reached it. pending-phase-c.ts keeps only that type and\nits create call, shaped and named as the generator will emit them, so\nremoving it later is an import change.","tree":{"sha":"9e736700477dbcf3140a1cc4420840c172dfc444","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/trees/9e736700477dbcf3140a1cc4420840c172dfc444"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/commits/9a85ddae04e2946d732c767417bcef0095bec294","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e736700477dbcf3140a1cc4420840c172dfc444\nparent 7b34f997aa722ef66802f03586654cddd9115ea5\nauthor Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1790355663 +0700\ncommitter Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1790355663 +0700\n\nchore(openapi): regenerate the iam and identity clients from staging\n\nRegenerated both groups against the live staging spec. milo#782 is\nserved there, so User.status.emailVerification now comes from the\ngenerated iam types and the hand-written iam stub is not needed.\n\nStaging also changed the identity group in ways this has to follow:\n- the schema keys moved from com.miloapis.go.milo to go.miloapis.com,\n  so every identity type is now prefixed GoMiloapisComMilo; the one\n  Session import in the profile page is renamed to match\n- Passkey list and read are generated now\n- Session.status dropped expiresAt and gained lastUpdatedAt and\n  userAgent, so the profile sessions table shows \"Last updated\" where\n  it showed \"Expires\", which could no longer be filled\n\nPasskeyRegistrationLink is still missing from staging: zitadel-provider\n#135 has not reached it. pending-phase-c.ts keeps only that type and\nits create call, shaped and named as the generator will emit them, so\nremoving it later is an import change.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEMx73jwm6xkYPRZJCQ276hNnNDiMFAmq2qNUbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEENu+oTZzQ4j8ZsP/A57j3wDja00m8XRy8H9\n9KeOnYixnwViqAlEJ/hhaOJ8SS+7IUXLgrgCoVoQzTz2Ypt/gEI4D8iQYi9kMFxx\nY3Br/jANtnmKip2Qy4joSI559I9MZHy5ahnUSeXYTIQ5keTRK9juIgQ/gHqWLq+8\nykWjJdsaio6EZlYxlGsMUqoRfo2LXarc1BLhPAUGMf2yhJuNDE3OqLI98WA9yUcj\nPdfivBvHv7fvbZlGJWBHz6OwQpbQFxzV6WO6OsawzOt2ZcsF8DgwlKd+Kn2UVM5j\nZkNcuCbiP0TTAWwgbNwsTT0lv9+W84j4mMqzGFDXIxqCrh0NppJ8KdlV6a4qbBT3\n3tkahXJ0oF8wbbr6ry4Qkcw7oPEkwQVxni3CcIg+Gv2KgDdaw9OJUvNVqXcjKydD\nX1j0uh0B9S+7v9P1pseaEDCEnIz+gbZdlELqrPOu21uolwIhF/3PuAfqg7qt3Qns\n5x2ikujQ02nMHvrTeUqjuV7zvpZDBg2GpNpMf4jO0tLbZab/j2GcQrh5CB/BERq6\nVkTnxVwqtXVSdYNbRzDazSFZtqMLlGwz3EuPmqFlUD1Qn+4Yg/qHTLbVwt+PjkyB\nR0Yx3m8L9E+IBdbvfCmMkD9eGI3xGHg4Wlp+WbAzihAcDI89gOyviS0viCH/4+fw\nkenasCRiSaxz6K86sQMB/6mD\n=Nf2Z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T17:04:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3510868?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yahyafakhroji","id":3510868,"login":"yahyafakhroji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTA4Njg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yahyafakhroji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.c