ages, paying for an otherwise-empty header strip.\nWhen there''s no title or bulk-action bar, the action now renders inline\nin the search/filter bar instead.","tree":{"sha":"35ca76a46ed1654db640638c90f9cd0672ff6a94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/trees/35ca76a46ed1654db640638c90f9cd0672ff6a94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/commits/28aba53ce9e2fc4096820ead535f7f6cf523f2da","verification":{"payload":"tree 35ca76a46ed1654db640638c90f9cd0672ff6a94\nparent cd17756b3e969ef3c036b05a76fa3b9c7b7bf395\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1790039642 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1790039642 -0700\n\nfeat(customers): default to Users list and reclaim CTA header space\n\nUsers is the more common landing point than Organizations, so the\nCustomers top-nav link and the left rail''s item order now lead with it,\nand /customers redirects there.\n\nListTable''s header row existed only to carry a bare CTA (e.g. Invite\nUser) on several list pages, paying for an otherwise-empty header strip.\nWhen there''s no title or bulk-action bar, the action now renders inline\nin the search/filter bar instead.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmqx1mMACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j0fig//T75SEAJYW4BKCQdEqUqS9ofHnIx9qKxUhJd8C4omZroT7qDTrrPoGP+7\nxTC69OCBiVzAjEe1ADPUTrVMNxUkS1t6H0fg+J4Yqa4WRE2XI/VpfroXCY8QgYeh\nmHuvGIkeosL0bRb6x3IeM9mPCneMi79o5fm3mKVXl/E+g8WVyroqFuZv5mt64W5a\nUBKQNE5lL859BKttkhkibZwFsfLaLdBChnf2Fkq7dn2N3oft4SxKe/1WlgNd8GOl\nWx4woq2DiBFgRA+4pJu2Ub1snm242HRJWCBkoz+2qyqsGEoWY20cb/0zl/TsXEg6\ntTju/Zui7MO4trlaAW+6Tdw7ffV+xvqvrg6Gcgguc/u6mglhCSAHU1jO7SiPbsi6\nGyxGPulFFT4xE53shN4+jo8KWwlaXWvklaY7EWvBhsWSkMiTvX9KDqj6hfn/AFtI\nl9GaWbz/VCYU0rwAPtXNwM5R9ajHrcj9LRZ1nzqktoPkl+7AtZnV3E1i5x6s/6qa\nEgqI1iHlNA0z32Eoyj7obsfsfCAOvUKQAwFr7HhE3+SDQg9RW505rMQqdgWW2jLP\nrxY4p9nuQiupGcM0c+ImYEXkmGPhfbEOOVQNEuW6XbVreuRKE5oSh3Y29XjHQ64q\n01qnUxJydQqPLukmcxdLlj0bOgEe