/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/7234410d7fe866f2b6201c847de988252f3c8c15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T05:08:30Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T05:08:30Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"test: cover the entity-scoped left nav (Phase 6)\n\n- use-entity-nav.cy.tsx: deepest-match-wins resolution, ancestor\n  inheritance when a leaf route declares no entityNav, undefined\n  fallback when nothing in the tree does, and that entityNav is\n  invoked with the route''s loader data + params.\n- milo-sub-nav.cy.tsx: D1 nested groups auto-expand on a matching\n  child URL, highlight only the active child, stay collapsed\n  otherwise (expandable by click), and the D4 default-expanded\n  entity header.\n- organizations.cy.ts: e2e smoke check that /customers/organizations/:name\n  shows the org''s own rail (Overview/Members/Quotas), not the Customers\n  section rail (Users/Billing Accounts/Fraud & Abuse), and that the\n  horizontal tab strip is gone.\n\nVerified with typecheck, eslint, and cypress run --component (full\nsuite green, including these). The e2e addition is typechecked/linted\nonly - not run here, it needs a live login/backend.","tree":{"sha":"6b5ddf5dec7c84ee025fbe0368a9d8fa5455bc4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/trees/6b5ddf5dec7c84ee025fbe0368a9d8fa5455bc4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/commits/7234410d7fe866f2b6201c847de988252f3c8c15","verification":{"payload":"tree 6b5ddf5dec7c84ee025fbe0368a9d8fa5455bc4e\nparent cef65a8e125486642e03523e5cbc503ee882a711\nautho