l_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/cef65a8e125486642e03523e5cbc503ee882a711/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T04:58:17Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T04:58:17Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"feat: show the entity nav in the mobile menu (Phase 5)\n\nWhen handle.entityNav is active, the hamburger sheet now opens on the\nentity''s own items (icon + title header, flat list - a children-bearing\nitem like Resources/Activity/Quotas renders as a plain group header with\nits children listed below, no collapse/expand since the sheet already\ncloses on tap) instead of the global sections, with a back affordance\nto reach them and vice versa. Off an entity route, unchanged.\n\nVerified the other two Phase 5 items need no code change: the entity\nheader lives inside the same fixed-height sticky <aside>, so the\nsticky offset math in dimensions.ts is untouched; the assistant panel\nis position: fixed and a sibling of MiloShell, not nested in its flex\nrow, so it''s unaffected by anything the rail does.\n\nVerified with typecheck and a production build.","tree":{"sha":"e72ce14336e7eec9d36bef7886413448f581039d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/trees/e72ce14336e7eec9d36bef7886413448f581039d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/commits/cef65a8e125486642e03523e5cbc503ee882a711","verification":{"payload":"tree e72ce14336e7eec9d36bef7886413448f581039d\nparent b7047deca1acb4eae2d1087c8ce34a2d52bb6d90\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1789793897 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1789793897 -0700\n\nfeat: show the entity nav in the mobile menu (Phase 5)\n\nWhen handle.entityNav is active, the hamburger sheet now opens on the\nentity''s own items (icon + title header, flat list - a children-bearing\nitem like Resources/Activity/Quotas renders as a plain group header with\nits children listed below, no collapse/expand since the sheet already\ncloses on tap) instead of the global sections, with a back affordance\nto reach them and vice versa. Off an entity route, unchanged.\n\nVerified the other two Phase 5 items need no code change: the entity\nheader lives inside the same fixed-height sticky <aside>, so the\nsticky offset math in dimensions.ts is untouched; the assistant panel\nis position: fixed and a sibling of MiloShell, not nested in its flex\nrow, so it''s unaffected by anything the rail does.\n\nVerified with typecheck and a production build.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmquFnAACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j0YWxAAquYpzeMiVc8RSQ3B7y4nsadOxh9OAcPUooW73o2JmLx4ce6lKJ3zDoL2\newKQKgj//HUJBUaZ5r2fhsPTilDZuLuv0wrk1QFLsZwvjrs3QS8DP8m5pWgKjb5g\n2ldYV7YeTHRBRgGeZ+GI2UwY/bn8js2zN0N0X912SmBo2K9BI+NgDv3L0NbdaLcq\nt7lMniQ4R9lpWkWv93Q8x68nYx7eV/vFwehgwKxvjzf8nIFH80YjoWyBkdR3Tez4\n9N1qyi3ci4U3/PKF3VD4gmgTygjksbrzWtTO0Z1RVZUtx99lV5AsoxPVSA0qU/tZ\naHL2qJZ9O2UZUs1qeZ8ZM9RFyIamdifcxXu7xUrg70eOldvYnas5ZYzYZM0k+0i4\neMi5Gdj/1hUoka96oK+lAakV/zdKV3QblacbILjFoaiDjJDuGcQKfmMeKWttxep8\niT/ozPRjv+QWIpolYmDNpB4YQtHo2JVFYc+IFG6nrsOL5KXeUdZahy3fJZEVCbfq\nYSr+sOLkGSdSMKI9ryIfFhTyPB/TP0lcpiWTVzyCc0uHb142wS8Vzh+WpD+2rqE8\n8uOhawjqwX85xrZ4Jsku1FAFZwudc3wMppwiF4ff/i0hkkC3OcIGi8sUTuY/bMDU\naX53IgQTu1OGOC7YaYFat5Ccap/Q0+