following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/b7047deca1acb4eae2d1087c8ce34a2d52bb6d90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T04:52:55Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T04:52:55Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"fix: give the shell''s main content area its own white background\n\nThe <main> region (routed page content) never had its own background\nclass, so it showed through to the shell wrapper''s bg-background\n(--glacier-mist-700, a light grey), not the white bg-card surface used\nelsewhere in the shell (e.g. active nav-item pills). Adds bg-card\ninstead of the ad-hoc #fff override applied via devtools while\nreviewing the entity rail.","tree":{"sha":"861d9213e27535dafbbbc96ebbec7bac140b9e0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/trees/861d9213e27535dafbbbc96ebbec7bac140b9e0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/commits/b7047deca1acb4eae2d1087c8ce34a2d52bb6d90","verification":{"payload":"tree 861d9213e27535dafbbbc96ebbec7bac140b9e0a\nparent 46ff112aaa8758ddf001b28b11041dd69597fa65\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1789793575 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1789793575 -0700\n\nfix: give the shell''s main content area its own white background\n\nThe <main> region (routed page content) never had its own background\nclass, so it showed through to the shell wrapper''s bg-background\n(--glacier-mist-700, a light grey), not the white bg-card surface used\nelsewhere in the shell (e.g. active nav-item pills). Adds bg-card\ninstead of the ad-hoc #fff override applied via devtools while\nreviewing the entity rail.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmquFS4ACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j3pAhAAliBX+vAbIsf6TmsodmfPKcfsODnyO4szMprdYJxCW02G55jpDFCVlHKG\neDjergGBaCTJ+HnYM5zWLsS61v7atJNWlJoXqG9E4u8cArD6TkPx4FJcmPVX1PUS\nlECs54IUh3tCeJkfNHrN0CD2B7Vx2iMHviOSSKG/mBezqvjqyXr8hn3iPd9XUJ8g\nDBEMx1fWEh2XQofAKEmvz0L1CjA1YPLjkNvlFjWPPXO22UYAzNmB7mUwoYSwFom0\ndYnUMPtUJxIeWoZP0ZhBixyw6nxQYLtsCaq7hP8EUNm4xg0mclgl1/GmtJywfv3X\nZXdgwYjp6ZF+2mHJ5jk9o5iuIdrB44682qRVSkNzuQZKEvoj80v2TuZ8iUBhXbRp\nQIHw8kz5X/2vaeFpq9ypv8NuEWFe4N1Gfz8JdVaZbriyy73jS8IHKOE2H5pWGU98\nRC5mt0gNWWt0eJr3mUwPP0qEru53lpAtPZd7kxlb1z7HNWfu8kkM9lxFoBSmsI5H\ni5YQJ41p6jO7p4XUvAcRPUsYA3II9zc5ewJ9lN2HYO95dM9qxGewKZkhqAZPBufH\njhKtLxeHoMVziVdkNq/0tmfxquPh5xlYVhpEPWqw9uO2XmUKPl2RcnAlb+JRnqXz\nqomyFbiEIjWq/G24BUFZPl02KiOuKsufOVf7eYftnZE2wzMimvU=\n=IKHa\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-19T05:08:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commit/b7047deca1acb4eae2d1087c8ce34a2d52bb6d90","node_id":"C_kwDOOl0d89oAKGI3MDQ3ZGVjYTFhY2I0ZWFlMmQxMDg3YzhjZTM0YTJkNTJiYjZkOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commit/46ff112aaa8758ddf001b28b11041dd69597fa65","sha":"46ff112aaa8758ddf001b28b11041dd69597fa65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/46ff112aaa8758ddf001b28b11041dd69597fa65"}],"sha":"b7047deca1acb4eae2d1087c8ce34a2d52bb6d90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/b7047deca1acb4eae2d1087c8ce34a2d52bb6d90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/46ff112aaa8758ddf001b28b11041dd69597fa65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T04:47:06Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T04:47:06Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"feat: migrate remaining entity detail layouts to the entity rail\n\nFinishes Phase 3 of the entity-scoped-left-nav plan (#775, #656):\nproject, user, service catalog, group, contact, and contact-group all\nmove tabs: EntityTab[] to handle.entityNav, same pattern as organization\n(#775 commit before this one) - params-derived name, entity-list backTo,\nplain-string labels (handle can''t use useLingui, tracked as an i18n\nfollow-up), tabs prop dropped from DetailShell.\n\n- project/detail/layout.tsx: Compute is plugin-gated\n  (findWorkloadListPluginSlug), a client hook that can''t live in handle.\n  use-entity-nav.ts''s withProjectCompute() splices it in after Domains\n  when the project route is active, matching the original tab order.\n  backTo points at the *organization''s* project list\n  (orgRoutes.project(orgName)), matching the breadcrumb - a project is\n  reached through its org, not the flat /customers/projects.\n- service-catalog/detail/layout.tsx: Approvals'' pending-count badge\n  (JSX, same as breadcrumb - no hook fires until React renders it) and\n  the plugin-contributed items (already resolved in the loader, not a\n  hook) both build fine inside handle.\n- user/group/contact/contact-group: no dynamic entries, straightforward\n  conversions.\n\nVerified with typecheck, eslint, and a production build.","tree":{"sha":"6887f255210864ef7bf9cfbf3e61e986f499d3b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/trees/6887f255210864ef7bf9cfbf3e61e986f499d3b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/commits/46ff112aaa8758ddf001b28b11041dd69597fa65","verification":{"payload":"tree 6887f255210864ef7bf9cfbf3e61e986f499d3b5\nparent a8058f0736bb433e03118f25f95686bd8996734c\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1789793226 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1789793226 -0700\n\nfeat: migrate remaining entity detail layouts to the entity rail\n\nFinishes Phase 3 of the entity-scoped-left-nav plan (#775, #656):\nproject, user, service catalog, group, contact, and contact-group all\nmove tabs: EntityTab[] to handle.entityNav, same pattern as organization\n(#775 commit before this one) - params-derived name, entity-list backTo,\nplain-string labels (handle can''t use useLingui, tracked as an i18n\nfollow-up), tabs prop dropped from DetailShell.\n\n- project/detail/layout.tsx: Compute is plugin-gated\n  (findWorkloadListPluginSlug), a client hook that can''t live in handle.\n  use-entity-nav.ts''s withProjectCompute() splices it in after Domains\n  when the project route is active, matching the original tab order.\n  backTo points at the *organization''s* project list\n  (orgRoutes.project(orgName)), matching the breadcrumb - a project is\n  reached through its org, not the flat /customers/projects.\n- service-catalog/detail/layout.tsx: Approvals'' pending-count badge\n  (JSX, same as breadcrumb - no hook fires until React renders it) and\n  the plugin-contributed items (already resolved in the loader, not a\n  hook) both build fine inside handle.\n- user/group/contact/contact-group: no dynamic entries, straightforward\n  conversions.\n\nVerified with typecheck, eslint, and a production build.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmquE9EACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j0+JhAAsq0x8HJ1C1WJNdfDeZkNMLxn8D+R/S7XAuXWgAKvVPqER+V1cJ3rfQqZ\nAoXt2U9Pk5OBacXJfDxCYwg999D9+PNcD0P9AY+oPTpx/kNEhAapQgjo9chXhuXW\noZKfHQPyMzhJOCSxZTSmDp7oO7m4/w2jb/+q5k2DGh3n7W4dDFL2QZ0FSDySaPpP\nrjWWEPeUzK8KsCeRrmCpeS4ozH+zIPV+4+jf91wTZ4ZU4UIXCOmk/XuC9565uTvb\nfbE3yLtemvCKm6frqCwULiY06cQUH2w/qpw9YjIJ+ostPCd4EWjOE/Thd106II96\nGNe8QdHnvie4Y4Cj7GIiRjlBUunkx5y0cbCwp1Zzw1