f112aaa8758ddf001b28b11041dd69597fa65"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/a8058f0736bb433e03118f25f95686bd8996734c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T04:32:54Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T04:32:54Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"feat: migrate organization detail nav to the entity rail\n\nPhase 3 (organization) of the entity-scoped-left-nav plan (#775, #656) —\nrichest case (all three D1 nesting kinds) and the one in the bug report.\n\n- organization/detail/layout.tsx: tabs: EntityTab[] moves to\n  handle.entityNav, converting EntityTab -> NavSubItem (children,\n  match, href, icon carry over as-is). orgName is now derived from\n  params.orgName instead of the component''s hooks. backTo points at\n  orgRoutes.list(). Labels are plain strings, not the t`` macro -\n  handle is module scope and can''t use useLingui (tracked as an i18n\n  follow-up per the plan, same gap NAV_SECTIONS already has).\n- detail-shell.tsx: tabs is now optional and EntityTabNav is skipped\n  when absent (Phase 4''s DetailShell change, pulled forward - dropping\n  organization''s tabs prop doesn''t type-check without it). Fraud,\n  Operations -> Activity, and /customers/resources still pass tabs and\n  are unaffected.\n\nAt /customers/organizations/:orgName the left rail now shows the org''s\nown nav (Overview/Projects/Resources/Members/Usage/Activity/Quotas/\nFeature Flags) with a back-link to Organizations, and the horizontal\ntab strip is gone. Verified with typecheck, eslint, and a production\nbuild.","tree":{"sha":"8d97a6ab4e48af4e242eaf2ba22b85abb30c948f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/trees/8d97a6ab4e48af4e242eaf2ba22b85abb30c948f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/commits/a8058f0736bb433e03118f25f95686bd8996734c","verification":{"payload":"tree 8d97a6ab4e48af4e242eaf2ba22b85abb30c948f\nparent c934c8eb6bfe780b92e193aa259fcfbf7d8e31e5\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1789792374 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1789792374 -0700\n\nfeat: migrate organization detail nav to the entity rail\n\nPhase 3 (organization) of the entity-scoped-left-nav plan (#775, #656) —\nrichest case (all three D1 nesting kinds) and the one in the bug report.\n\n- organization/detail/layout.tsx: tabs: EntityTab[] moves to\n  handle.entityNav, converting EntityTab -> NavSubItem (children,\n  match, href, icon carry over as-is). orgName is now derived from\n  params.orgName instead of the component''s hooks. backTo points at\n  orgRoutes.list(). Labels are plain strings, not the t`` macro -\n  handle is module scope and can''t use useLingui (tracked as an i18n\n  follow-up per the plan, same gap NAV_SECTIONS already has).\n- detail-shell.tsx: tabs is now optional and EntityTabNav is skipped\n  when absent (Phase 4''s DetailShell change, pulled forward - dropping\n  organization''s tabs prop doesn''t type-check without it). Fraud,\n  Operations -> Activity, and /customers/resources still pass tabs and\n  are unaffected.\n\nAt /customers/organizations/:orgName the left rail now shows the org''s\nown nav (Overview/Projects/Resources/Members/Usage/Activity/Quotas/\nFeature Flags) with a back-link to Organizations, and the horizontal\ntab strip is gone. Verified with typecheck, eslint, and a production\nbuild.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmquEH0ACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j2Rhw/6A69J1b8t+KomO17kKII5nAJATnKUge4d1gQSUHMQ0UGggVWEdUmbPXyy\nEx9F+sM+D+WrPTyaUNCg3DD4RE/l3UsM9XP3KdJXCYCe/AWKo0EWGqA0ktMPCvkM\nproG0esBuyOnTuec5oSwiE1MpeFGPfWHijBr8RWmpUDjElbNHfKmLIM0sanaIQyR\n4t2RdQozxMh0zYTLssYyC1Ny7gP1owAyfI2hwgwEXlJ1HmXlYgpptMzEHD8Dkgce\n3WT70yeB3fnBxWoRFvHXcRyX3N729kosTGTrbzQsvm37Qo+YkHhOY6AIXVmm6qhj\nQPD5O5gostgK+oMYHh4+OBdbdpP7sUgS+14zuVVe5UUU6nyMY0ZVX85qeaWj102z\nC5k4wJhAZbdsWpQ3HBIbqjT+wGUV1MDfP4ryyvAqO2XUVCBSKKu+5RtW27PZwjUe\np04R2TFAUNkodnves+88zDnqVYEup6Q4yDHUW3K97h2qbnAlNa2b4f4/hSX4Mxnn\nogrd9FMs63D+1ZU1BqnI6ghjA5FwlemIfoMxNv+VF2Mgo85HmT9lxo7iGi/LMpDX\nsvu2eFcURgnX0eBu701YEPRS8SDuEYPCXz4DvWWSQSlo1WiFesxgiekAqvdUzJsQ\ng65lymj1EMHJRDGZev9c+ezDc5DRWEhQTAT6ugMoXc+GT7NGTgQ=\n=yLbv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-19T05:08:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commit/a8058f0736bb433e03118f25f95686bd8996734c","node_id":"C_kwDOOl0d89oAKGE4MDU4ZjA3MzZiYjQzM2UwMzExOGYyNWY5NTY4NmJkODk5NjczNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commit/c934c8eb6bfe780b92e193aa259fcfbf7d8e31e5","sha":"c934c8eb6bfe780b92e193aa259fcfbf7d8e31e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/c934c8eb6bfe780b92e193aa259fcfbf7d8e31e5"}],"sha":"a8058f0736bb433e03118f25f95686bd8996734c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/a8058f0736bb433e03118f25f95686bd8996734c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kevwilliams","id":1724763,"login":"kevwilliams","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ3NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevwilliams","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/c934c8eb6bfe780b92e193aa259fcfbf7d8e31e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T04:32:08Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T04:32:08Z","email":"kwilliams@datum.net","name":"Kevin"},"message":"feat: add entity-scoped left nav infrastructure\n\nPhases 1-2 of the entity-scoped-left-nav plan (#775, #656).\n\n- nav-config.ts: EntityNav type; NavSubItem gains children (D1 nested\n  collapsible groups) and badge; href becomes optional since a\n  parent-with-children row is a disclosure, not a link.\n- use-entity-nav.ts: useEntityNav() resolves the active route''s\n  handle.entityNav via useMatches(), deepest match wins. Calls\n  usePlugins() unconditionally so a future hook-derived entry (project''s\n  Compute tab) can be injected without a conditional-hook hazard.\n- use-active-subnav-item.ts: longest-prefix active-item resolution\n  extended one level for D1''s nested groups, shared by section and\n  entity rails.\n- use-subnav-collapsed.ts: D3 persisted collapse state (localStorage,\n  SSR-safe default, syncs across tabs via the storage event).\n- milo-sub-nav.tsx / milo-sub-nav-item.tsx: rail now renders either a\n  section''s NavSubNav or an entity''s EntityNav; EntityNav gets a\n  backTo + icon + title header (D2); items with children render as an\n  auto-expanding, collapsible group (D1); entity rail defaults expanded\n  (D4).\n- milo-shell.tsx: renders useEntityNav() ?? section?.subNav.\n\nNo route yet declares handle.entityNav, so this is not user visible.","tree":{"sha":"3c5dad3ac2e61a0698ab2e7bc40b937f113f4a46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/trees/3c5dad3ac2e61a0698ab2e7bc40b937f113f4a46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/commits/c934c8eb6bfe780b92e193aa259fcfbf7d8e31e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 3c5dad3ac2e61a0698ab2e7bc40b937f113f4a46\nparent 749e2d65c9e1352c1bc4e97e9261dcdac26e59fe\nauthor Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1789792328 -0700\ncommitter Kevin <kwilliams@datum.net> 1789792328 -0700\n\nfeat: add entity-scoped left nav infrastructure\n\nPhases 1-2 of the entity-scoped-left-nav plan (#775, #656).\n\n- nav-config.ts: EntityNav type; NavSubItem gains children (D1 nested\n  collapsible groups) and badge; href becomes optional since a\n  parent-with-children row is a disclosure, not a link.\n- use-entity-nav.ts: useEntityNav() resolves the active route''s\n  handle.entityNav via useMatches(), deepest match wins. Calls\n  usePlugins() unconditionally so a future hook-derived entry (project''s\n  Compute tab) can be injected without a conditional-hook hazard.\n- use-active-subnav-item.ts: longest-prefix active-item resolution\n  extended one level for D1''s nested groups, shared by section and\n  entity rails.\n- use-subnav-collapsed.ts: D3 persisted collapse state (localStorage,\n  SSR-safe default, syncs across tabs via the storage event).\n- milo-sub-nav.tsx / milo-sub-nav-item.tsx: rail now renders either a\n  section''s NavSubNav or an entity''s EntityNav; EntityNav gets a\n  backTo + icon + title header (D2); items with children render as an\n  auto-expanding, collapsible group (D1); entity rail defaults expanded\n  (D4).\n- milo-shell.tsx: renders useEntityNav() ?? section?.subNav.\n\nNo route yet declares handle.entityNav, so this is not user visible.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEb8FNfGdgytwOrlKr53J8QGQJ2j0FAmquEFEACgkQ53J8QGQJ\n2j1NJA//QU3R0UHqtUJ4kWv6PvZGf1NNmIT3O1fFGoTrebRxS9Wd+ikU2sydOO3O\nx+2rC78UgSw8pEmpOb67P2a9eSggw4GBVPnC0w2Stc+3Vn8XyUxdPTpcM3rzxaEE\nMcMtOArheIjDLvXvNEEivZmY78WPKsBiKeHpQDSsDepVIErz51IUjkYkWE7igEch\nB/2tYAGEB3y2zSMlu6usdgSP5DSfERs/qiRRk66hAIN244i/+iByQNbL6rhRUsqI\ntKhIi13DaHLjiWZICYGBvnNn0mRrITBh/qvQCOTEoln+aTK7VaXBYZ48u8rxWSRb\nQAvZmsY86O+3sNC2j9tanAIkVM4tGhnmXyXDtgSBAjs56mpAfS9cDKA+vUzrBm1r\nGJgJX9cFbYvRxRcr9jf1y7E1QCNcAuaVe8FkHWsBEVIOYBYjTaY6kkM5aO7BuHOh\nOOcd4RkcDc0u