ng_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmertens-datum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmertens-datum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bmertens-datum","id":227616399,"login":"bmertens-datum","node_id":"U_kgDODZEmjw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmertens-datum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmertens-datum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmertens-datum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmertens-datum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmertens-datum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmertens-datum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/commits/4877130fdfe1b3cd31b7bc1120c0d3e97b8c8136/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T17:57:28Z","email":"bmertens@datum.net","name":"bmertens-datum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T17:57:28Z","email":"bmertens@datum.net","name":"bmertens-datum"},"message":"feat: serve per-run step timing for the Chainsaw Tests dashboard\n\nAdds POST /api/chainsaw-tests/step-timing so the dashboard''s new\nrun-timing dialog (chainsaw-tests-plugin#11) has real data to show:\ngiven a test/suite/environment and a run''s approximate timestamp, it\nresolves the exact run, returns each step''s duration/pass-fail in\nexecution order, and compares each to a historical average.\n\nKey pieces:\n- app/server/lib/vm-query.ts: MCP query helpers extracted from the\n  near-identical copies in chainsaw-tests.ts and cluster.ts, plus\n  seriesKey() for joining two queries'' results by label set\n- app/server/lib/chainsaw-step-timing.ts (+ .test.ts): pure logic\n  turning four VictoriaMetrics query results into the response shape,\n  independently tested without any MCP/network dependency. Step order\n  comes from chainsaw_test_step_start_offset_seconds''s value, not a\n  label, since Prometheus label sets are unordered and a step-index\n  label would rename every downstream step''s series on insertion\n- The detail endpoint uses instant queries (last_over_time /\n  timestamp_with_name / avg_over_time / count_over_time, all at the\n  requested time) rather than paired range queries -- simpler, and\n  avoids a real MetricsQL footgun where a bare selector and a\n  same-bracket rollup function can default to different implicit\n  windows and desync\n- Also fixes the existing list endpoint''s history timestamps the same\n  way: paired with timestamp_with_name so each tick carries its real\n  CI push time instead of the query_range grid point, and tightens\n  the grid from 1h to 30m so fewer same-window runs collapse onto one\n  tick\n- Request validated with zod (test/suite/environment against a safe\n  label character class) before reaching PromQL interpolation -- the\n  first route in this pipeline where a caller-supplied string reaches\n  a query\n\nVerified: typecheck, lint, full build, and the new unit tests all\nclean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c3759c6820b89baf26f35f502cd3d08aaff637b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/trees/1c3759c6820b89baf26f35f502cd3d08aaff637b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/staff-portal/git/commits/4877130fdfe1b3cd31b7bc1120c0d3e97b8c8136","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/227616399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmertens-datum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmertens-datum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmertens-datum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmertens-datum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bmertens-da