.herceg@gmail.com","name":"filip-herceg"},"message":"Adds literature footnote plugin and updates docs\n\nIntegrates the Literature Footnote Classification plugin into setup tasks and documentation, providing a detailed user and developer guide. Updates the demo video link, improves plugin setup instructions, and replaces crypto-based test randomness for broader compatibility in tests.\n\nEnhances clarity on plugin features, configuration, and ReViewPoint integration, supporting better citation analysis workflows.","tree":{"sha":"5d87f0d500937742b6e559ae82873fb64164a9a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/filip-herceg/ReViewPoint/git/trees/5d87f0d500937742b6e559ae82873fb64164a9a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/filip-herceg/ReViewPoint/git/commits/31f7c04bab4dee7ac921bf3cc867bd7af3a01464","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92739281?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filip-herceg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filip-herceg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filip-herceg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filip-herceg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/filip-herceg","id":92739281,"login":"filip-herceg","node_id":"U_kgDOBYcW0Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filip-herceg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filip-herceg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filip-herceg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filip-herceg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filip-herceg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/filip-herceg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/filip-herceg/ReViewPoint/commit/31f7c04bab4dee7ac921bf3cc867bd7af3a0146