os/filip-herceg/ReViewPoint/commits/9dddf96b1bf518489066a5be3ed207b87c78dbcb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-12T14:35:18Z","email":"pvt.filip.herceg@gmail.com","name":"filip-herceg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-12T14:35:18Z","email":"pvt.filip.herceg@gmail.com","name":"filip-herceg"},"message":"Refactor fast test runner and update configurations\n\n- Updated the path for the fast test script in tasks.json to use the correct directory.\n- Modified pyproject.toml to streamline author information and adjust dependency formatting.\n- Renamed and refactored the fast test runner script, enhancing its functionality and clarity.\n- Updated conftest.py to improve environment variable handling and logging during test execution.\n- Adjusted test_openapi_demo.py to use the correct database URL format for SQLite.\n- Removed the legacy fast test script as its functionality has been integrated into the new runner.\n\nRefactors fast test runner and streamlines test config\n\nRefactors the fast test runner for clarity and maintainability, integrating legacy functionality and improving environment variable handling for more reliable test execution.\n\nUpdates configuration files and scripts to reflect the new runner location, ensures consistent SQLite URL usage, and enhances logging and marker registration in test setup.\n\nRemoves redundant legacy scripts and cleans up formatting in configuration for better readability.\n\nImproves developer experience by making fast test execution more robust and configuration-driven.","tree":{"sha":"de8b804b73b4ced6f30b05028fd2def41396ec70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/filip-herceg/ReViewPoint/git/trees/de8b804b73b4ced6f30b05028fd2def41396ec70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/filip-herceg/ReViewPoint/git/commits/9dddf96b1bf518489066a5be3ed207b87c78dbcb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.git